<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ho Hup 1996 net up 23.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ho Hup 1996 net up 23.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 36.14   vs	 29.25</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	60.2    vs	 48.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		  666.00   vs	410.97</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   51.38   vs	 44.16</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 2.73   vs   less 1.64</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    -     vs	 21.90</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)     10.0    vs	 20.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Ho Hup Construction Co Bhd is involved in engineering works, building construction and selling of ready-mixed concrete.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
